  "releaseNotes": "Improves encoder and decoder performance by removing LINQ allocations from hot paths and making the plan cache lock-free. Fixes typed round-tripping for nullable enums and broader BCL scalar types, and improves XML documentation across public and internal APIs.\n- Improves throughput by replacing LINQ .All() with foreach loops in NativeNormalize, NativeEncoders, and NativePathExpansion\n- Improves concurrency safety of ClrEncodePlanCache by switching from lock+Dictionary to ConcurrentDictionary.GetOrAdd\n- Improves encoder efficiency by lazy-allocating the siblings array only when KeyFolding is Safe\n- Removes unused System.Linq imports from NativeNormalize and NativePathExpansion\n- Fixes typed round-tripping for nullable enums and broader BCL scalar types\n- Improves XML documentation across public and internal APIs",
